{"version":1,"content":"<p>【屏幕災情】Apple 首款摺疊智能手機 iPhone Duo 才剛開賣，全球已經傳出大量摺疊屏幕「爆 Mon」災情。</p><p>有分析師發現爆裂位置近乎完全相同。</p><p>硬體分析師 UniverseIce 分享了他手上的 iPhone Duo 情況，才用了一天，中間的鉸鏈便慢慢凸起，而且變得越來越明顯，相信盲的也能摸得出來，現在沒爆只是「時辰未到」而已。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:03.056910+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T07:02:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T06:58:07.067985+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.800174+00:00","content_hash":"d516419557ddd7110ba6f97ae2419efd1a94d96dab2d646ba0aeea364bdcf236","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}